              "variable": [
                {
                  "key": "id",
                  "value": "booking-uuid"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Requires TECHNICIAN role. Transitions: PENDING->ACCEPTED/REJECTED/CANCELLED, ACCEPTED->IN_PROGRESS/CANCELLED, IN_PROGRESS->COMPLETED/CANCELLED. Rejecting/cancelling frees the availability slot."
